{
  "id": "201601",
  "resourceId": 16,
  "name": "拉毗：小紅帽",
  "skin": "耀光",
  "spineVersion": "4.0",
  "skel": "c016_03_00.skel",
  "atlas": "c016_03_00.atlas",
  "defaultAnimation": "idle",
  "interactions": [
    {
      "id": "voice_01",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_01.mp3",
      "text": "指揮官，\n我想對下次作戰行動提出一點意見。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_02",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_02.mp3",
      "text": "您的視線好像無法從泳衣上移開呢，\n幸好您很喜歡。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_03",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_03.mp3",
      "text": "人家有點累。\n先借指揮官的床休息一下下。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_04",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_04.mp3",
      "text": "狀態全綠燈，沒有比這更好的事了。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_05",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_05.mp3",
      "text": "指揮官，要一起去游泳嗎？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_06",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_06.mp3",
      "text": "……指揮官。\n這顆枕頭的設計，是不是還不錯？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_07.mp3",
      "text": "我在指揮官眼中是什麼樣的人？\n我想知道您的個人看法。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_08.mp3",
      "text": "水溫和涼風都恰到好處。\n大概是和指揮官在一起的緣故，感覺真完美。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_09.mp3",
      "text": "我聽說指揮官喜歡這種衣服。\n您可以盡情地看。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_10.mp3",
      "text": "很期待我們將來能一起做點什麼。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_11.mp3",
      "text": "雖然現在做別的事情還太早了，\n但您想要的話，可以牽我的手。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_12",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_12.mp3",
      "text": "指揮官，您不累嗎？\n您儘管休息，我會陪在您身邊的。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_13.mp3",
      "text": "我絕對不會死，也不會精神崩潰。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_14.mp3",
      "text": "我來親自幫您塗防曬乳吧。\n……我一直很想試試看。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_15",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_15.mp3",
      "text": "指揮官，無論您要求我做什麼，\n我的答案永遠都是「好」。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_16.mp3",
      "text": "我要揹負起我所傳承的東西，繼續走下去。\n還請您拭目以待。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_17.mp3",
      "text": "夏天是個非常危險的季節，\n但我一定會保護好指揮官，請別擔心。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_18.mp3",
      "text": "看到指揮官這反應，\n就覺得我的努力真的沒白費呢。\n……所以，可以給人家一點獎勵嗎？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_19",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_19.mp3",
      "text": "我可以在等待的時候做一點自己的事嗎？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_20",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_20.mp3",
      "text": "可能是因為天氣炎熱的關係，\n總覺得今天的等待特別漫長。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_21",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_21.mp3",
      "text": "像這樣……？\n不對，要再稍微有點害羞的感覺……",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_22",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_22.mp3",
      "text": "我在尋找自己喜歡的音樂，\n希望這次能如願。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_23",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_23.mp3",
      "text": "您無需感到不安。\n我會一如既往地在這裡等著指揮官。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_24",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_24.mp3",
      "text": "指揮官，今天跟我……原來您在忙啊。\n……那我現在就先靜靜地陪在您身邊吧。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_25",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_25.mp3",
      "text": "仔細想想，我在這裡已經待了很久了。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_26",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_26.mp3",
      "text": "好不容易穿一次泳裝，不去泳池太可惜了。\n走吧，指揮官。就我們兩個人。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_27",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_27.mp3",
      "text": "啊，指揮官，我正好要回房間休息，\n您要不要一起去？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_28",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_28.mp3",
      "text": "可能是因為發生了很多事，\n所以逐漸覺得這個地方……有點像我的故鄉。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_29",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_29.mp3",
      "text": "希望下次尼恩和阿妮斯也可以一起來。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_30",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_30.mp3",
      "text": "該怎麼做才能和指揮官在同一張床上迎接早晨……",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_31",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_31.mp3",
      "text": "雖然這只是我個人的看法，\n但我覺得指揮官室需要有一個祕密空間。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_32",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_32.mp3",
      "text": "指揮官，您在看哪裡呀？\n不過……您可以一直看沒關係。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_33",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_33.mp3",
      "text": "咦？我並不怎麼害羞……\n……果然表現出害羞的樣子很有效嗎？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_34",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_34.mp3",
      "text": "再次請您多多指教，指揮官。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_35",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_35.mp3",
      "text": "這是我根據指揮官的品味精心挑選的泳裝。\n您喜歡嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_36",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_36.mp3",
      "text": "您好，指揮官。\n您看起來很累，一起去休息吧。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_37",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_37.mp3",
      "text": "功率上限提升。\n涵蓋的功能更多了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_38",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_38.mp3",
      "text": "嗯，這樣就足夠了。\n我還可以變得更強。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_39",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_39.mp3",
      "text": "為了我們的未來，\n我會變得更強。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_40",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_40.mp3",
      "text": "確認軀體等級提升。\n不知道最高能提升到什麼程度？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_41",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_41.mp3",
      "text": "很好。\n我還能更進一步。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_42",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_42.mp3",
      "text": "只要是為了指揮官，\n要我變得多強都沒問題。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_43",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_43.mp3",
      "text": "戰鬥數據更新完畢。\n真是太神奇了。居然能用這種方法變強。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_44",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_44.mp3",
      "text": "我突然好想知道，\n如果一直追隨指揮官的話，\n我能進步到什麼程度呢？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_45",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_45.mp3",
      "text": "沒錯。如果想承受住指揮官，不強健一點是不行的。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_46",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_46.mp3",
      "text": "指揮官不需要什麼嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_47",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_47.mp3",
      "text": "您現在是在撩我嗎？\n當然，指揮官想怎麼撩都可以。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_48",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_48.mp3",
      "text": "……指揮官，我會表現出害羞的樣子給您看，\n能不能告訴我您喜不喜歡呢？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_49",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_49.mp3",
      "text": "您給太多了。\n……您的資金狀況沒問題嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_50",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_50.mp3",
      "text": "我能感受到指揮官的品味呢。謝謝您的禮物。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_51",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_51.mp3",
      "text": "指揮官，回禮已經準備好了。\n晚上請到我的房間來。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_52",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_52.mp3",
      "text": "……這正是我想要的。\n您果然比我自己還瞭解我。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_53",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_53.mp3",
      "text": "指揮官果然比我還瞭解我自己。\n……您居然看出了我喜歡這個。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_54",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_54.mp3",
      "text": "謝謝您，指揮官。\n作為報答，我會將自己獻給您。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_55",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_55.mp3",
      "text": "指揮官，也許……\n算了，就當我什麼都沒說吧。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_56",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_56.mp3",
      "text": "我覺得很溫馨。\n這都是多虧了指揮官。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_57",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_57.mp3",
      "text": "指揮官，我……\n……沒事，當我什麼都沒說吧。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_58",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_58.mp3",
      "text": "您有時間嗎？\n我有問題想諮詢您。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_59",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_59.mp3",
      "text": "心跳加快的原因……應該不只是因為天氣炎熱。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_60",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_60.mp3",
      "text": "有時候，只要待在指揮官身邊……\n我就會覺得其他的事好像都無所謂了。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_61",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_61.mp3",
      "text": "我不會辜負您的期待的。\n沒錯，一定不會。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_62",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_62.mp3",
      "text": "我對指揮官的真心永遠不會變的。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_63",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_63.mp3",
      "text": "我也會努力用更好的方式，\n向指揮官表達自己的心意。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_64",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_64.mp3",
      "text": "收到，參與作戰。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_65",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_65.mp3",
      "text": "我們出發吧，指揮官。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_66",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_66.mp3",
      "text": "您比較喜歡在外面嗎？\n我開玩笑的。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_67",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_67.mp3",
      "text": "正在等待指令。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_68",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_68.mp3",
      "text": "是，請下令。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_69",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_69.mp3",
      "text": "是，指揮官。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_70",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_70.mp3",
      "text": "前往目標地點。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_71",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_71.mp3",
      "text": "前往該地點。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_72",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_72.mp3",
      "text": "動作快。還有事情等著我們回去做。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_73",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_73.mp3",
      "text": "遇敵。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_74",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_74.mp3",
      "text": "遇敵。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_75",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_75.mp3",
      "text": "遇敵。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_76",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_76.mp3",
      "text": "交戰開始。\n指揮官，到我身後去。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_77",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_77.mp3",
      "text": "確認目標！開始戰鬥。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_78",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_78.mp3",
      "text": "我會速戰速決。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_79",
      "category": "開始戰鬥II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_79.mp3",
      "text": "發現敵機。開始攻擊。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_80",
      "category": "開始戰鬥II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_80.mp3",
      "text": "迅速消滅敵人。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_81",
      "category": "開始戰鬥II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_81.mp3",
      "text": "要快點和指揮官兩個人……沒什麼。",
